    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1071835874213507204, 1067520653718192159, 1047942339055849512, 1046492707813605497, 1015599038575423538, 1015600525032558642, 1015600741878083684, 978353913046650900 --> $(l)Craft the Food Book early$() to track eaten foods and maximize variety bonuses—unique foods add permanent hearts at milestones."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(l)Avoid crafting treated wood with multiple creosote oil cans$()—this is unintended and likely buggy. $(l)Stand in Liquid Meat$() for fast saturation recovery; it fills saturation quickly without needing refills. $(l)Use the Crafting Table on a Stick$() instead of the Handheld Crafting Table—it’s faster, more performant, and supports advanced grid operations."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(l)Do not store Astral Shrine crystals in a Sack of Holding$()—it may disrupt the Starlight Network. $(l)Repair infusion crystals$() by applying Mending via the Mana Enchanter, or by putting them in a tank of liquid experience. $(l)Shickaxes can double as hoes$()—useful for early farming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(l)Craft purification scrolls from Coralis$() to remove all debuffs (warp, blindness, poison, etc.) for 10+ minutes. $(l)Obtain Magic Wands early$() by trading evil wizards (2 emeralds + 2 magic crystals), skipping dragon kills. $(l)Use the Fosic Resonator at night$() to find starlight patches for the Attunement Altar;"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "build it ≥Y=120 for best results."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(li)Villager houses each contain a unique AbyssalCraft coin required for the Dire Pick super-enchant—verify which coin type each house holds before looting.$(li)The large Astral Shrine contains a Collector Crystal—key for later progression."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(li)Pillar structures (e.g., Arcana Tomb, Torchero, Alumite Forks) vary widely in rarity: some spawn as rarely as 1 in 3000 chunks."
    }
